sequenceDiagram
    participant STM as STM32F4 buttons
    participant CAN as SocketCAN can0
    participant Bridge as can-daemon
    participant IPC as CanIpcClient
    participant Control as PlayerController
    participant UI as Qt Multimedia / QML
    STM->>CAN: Command frame 0x100
    CAN->>Bridge: Read raw CAN socket
    Bridge->>Bridge: Check CAN ID/DLC and decode packet
    Bridge->>IPC: Unix datagram to /tmp/qt_app_ipc.sock
    IPC->>IPC: Validate checksum
    alt Valid checksum
        IPC->>Control: Play / Pause / Next / Previous / Seek
        Control->>UI: Request playback action
        UI->>Control: Actual state and timeline
    else Invalid checksum
        IPC->>IPC: Drop packet and log warning
    end
    opt Application calls sendStatus - no automatic timer is connected
        IPC->>Bridge: Status to /tmp/can_ipc.sock
        Bridge->>CAN: Encode 0x101, big-endian time fields
        CAN->>STM: Status frame
    end
